# 基础词 Unit09
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023红宝书考研英语词汇-基础词
# 描述: 基础词Unit09核心词汇

{{capital}}{/ˈkæpɪtl/}{{n. 首都；资本；adj. 大写的}}{{Beijing is the capital of China.}}
{{capture}}{/ˈkæptʃər/}{{v. 捕获；夺取；n. 捕获}}{{The photographer captured the beautiful moment on camera.}}
{{carbon}}{/ˈkɑːrbən/}}n. 碳}}{{Reducing carbon emissions is crucial for the environment.}}
{{card}}{/kɑːrd/}{{n. 卡片；纸牌}}{{She sent a birthday card to her friend.}}
{{care}}{/keər/}{{v. 关心；n. 照顾；忧虑}}{{The nurse took good care of the patients.}}
{{career}}{/kəˈrɪər/}}n. 职业；生涯}}{{She has had a successful career in education.}}
{{careful}}{/ˈkeərfl/}{{adj. 仔细的；小心的}}{{Be careful when crossing the street.}}
{{cargo}}{/ˈkɑːrɡəʊ/}{{n. 货物；船货}}{{The ship carried a large cargo of electronics.}}
{{carry}}{/ˈkæri/}{{v. 携带；搬运；传送}}{{Could you help me carry these boxes upstairs?}}
{{case}}{/keɪs/}}n. 情况；案例；箱子}}{{In that case, we should reconsider our plan.}}
{{cash}}{/kæʃ/}{{n. 现金；v. 兑现}}{{I don't have enough cash to pay for this.}}
{{cast}}{/kɑːst/}{{v. 投；铸造；n. 演员阵容}}{{The movie has an impressive cast of famous actors.}}
{{casual}}{/ˈkæʒuəl/}}adj. 随便的；非正式的}}{{The dress code for the party is casual.}}
{{catalog}}{/ˈkætəlɒɡ/}{{n. 目录；v. 编目录}}{{The library catalog is available online.}}
{{catch}}{/kætʃ/}{{v. 抓住；赶上；n. 捕获物}}{{The cat tried to catch the butterfly.}}
{{category}}{/ˈkætəɡəri/}{{n. 类别；种类}}{{The books are organized by category on the shelves.}}
{{cattle}}{/ˈkætl/}{{n. 牛；家畜}}{{The farmer has a large herd of cattle.}}
{{cause}}{/kɔːz/}{{n. 原因；事业；v. 导致}}{{What was the cause of the accident?}}
{{caution}}{/ˈkɔːʃn/}{{n. 谨慎；警告；v. 警告}}{{The sign serves as a caution to drivers.}}
{{cease}}{/siːs/}{{v. 停止；终止}}{{The factory ceased production due to lack of demand.}}
{{celebrate}}{/ˈselɪbreɪt/}}v. 庆祝；赞美}}{{They celebrated their wedding anniversary with a dinner.}}
{{cell}}{/sel/}}n. 细胞；牢房；电池}}{{The human body is made up of trillions of cells.}}
{{center}}{/ˈsentər/}}n. 中心；v. 集中}}{{The shopping center is always crowded on weekends.}}
{{central}}{/ˈsentrəl/}{{adj. 中心的；主要的}}{{The central issue is how to reduce costs.}}
{{century}}{/ˈsentʃəri/}}n. 世纪；百年}}{{The building was constructed in the 19th century.}}
{{ceremony}}{/ˈserɪməni/}}n. 典礼；仪式}}{{The graduation ceremony was held in the auditorium.}}
{{certain}}{/ˈsɜːrtn/}}adj. 确定的；某些}}{{I am certain that he will pass the exam.}}
{{chain}}{/tʃeɪn/}{{n. 链条；连锁；v. 束缚}}{{The dog was chained to the fence.}}
{{chair}}{/tʃeər/}{{n. 椅子；主席}}{{Please have a seat in that chair.}}
{{chairman}}{/ˈtʃeərmən/}{{n. 主席；董事长}}{{The chairman opened the meeting with a short speech.}}
{{challenge}}{/ˈtʃælɪndʒ/}{{n. 挑战；v. 挑战}}{{Learning a new language is always a challenge.}}
{{champion}}{/ˈtʃæmpiən/}{{n. 冠军；拥护者}}{{She became the world champion in swimming.}}
{{chance}}{/tʃɑːns/}{{n. 机会；可能性}}{{There is a good chance of rain tomorrow.}}
{{change}}{/tʃeɪndʒ/}{{v. 改变；n. 变化；零钱}}{{The city has changed a lot over the past decade.}}
{{channel}}{/ˈtʃænl/}{{n. 频道；渠道；海峡}}{{The English Channel separates England from France.}}
{{chapter}}{/ˈtʃæptər/}{{n. 章；回}}{{Please read the first chapter of the book for homework.}}
{{character}}{/ˈkærəktər/}{{n. 性格；角色；文字}}{{He is a man of strong character.}}
{{charge}}{/tʃɑːrdʒ/}{{v. 收费；指控；n. 费用；掌管}}{{The museum charges a small admission fee.}}
{{charity}}{/ˈtʃærəti/}{{n. 慈善；慈善机构}}{{The charity raised millions of dollars for disaster relief.}}
{{chart}}{/tʃɑːrt/}{{n. 图表；海图；v. 制图表}}{{The chart shows the growth trend over five years.}}
